  gloves:   '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="M7 11 V 6 Q 7 4 9 4 V 11 M 11 11 V 4 Q 11 3 12 3 Q 13 3 13 4 V 11 M 13 11 V 5 Q 13 4 14 4 Q 15 4 15 5 V 11 M 15 11 V 7 Q 15 6 16 6 Q 17 6 17 7 V 14 Q 17 20 12 20 Q 7 20 7 14 Z"/></svg>',
